# External-source attribution

When adding or using an external package, API, webpage, dataset, image, icon,
font, code sample, media file, service, or other third-party resource:

- cite the canonical source in both `README.md` and
  `templates/references.html` in the same change;
- state what the resource contributes;
- record its licence or required attribution when available; and
- do not add resources with unknown ownership or unclear reuse terms.

Prefer original provider and project documentation over aggregators. Clearly
label incomplete provenance for inherited resources until they are replaced or
fully attributed.
